  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Array Methods\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Enter a song and artist, then click **Add to End**. Watch how the list changes.\r\n\r\n2. In **script.js**, highlight the `addRequest()` function and ask AI:\r\n\r\n   > How does the `addRequest()` function use an array method to change the list?\r\n\r\n3. Check the AI’s response:\r\n\r\n   * Does the explanation match what you actually observed?\r\n   * What evidence in the code supports or contradicts the explanation?\r\n\r\n4. Above `addRequest()`, add a `//` comment explaining how it changes the array.\r\n\r\n5. Repeat these steps for the other buttons and functions:\r\n\r\n   * **VIP Bump** → `vipBump()`\r\n   * **Play Next** → `playNext()`\r\n   * **Veto Last** → `vetoLast()`\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
